      "width": 440,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "# 📅 2026-11-21 デイリートレンド\n\n**🔥 本日の最重要ニュース**\nAnthropicの非公開Claudeがリーマン予想を「証明」か——形式検証言語Leanで25万行のコードを出力\n\n[出典リンク](https://www.forbes.com/sites/sandycarter/2026/11/20/the-anthropic-record-breaking-ipo-explained-in-7-key-facts/)"
    },
    {
      "id": "entities_summary",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -480,
      "y": -50,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "### 🏢 注目企業\n- [[Entities/Google|Google]]\n- [[Entities/Anthropic|Anthropic]]\n- [[Entities/Meta|Meta]]\n- [[Entities/Apple|Apple]]\n- [[Entities/NVIDIA|NVIDIA]]\n- [[Entities/Amazon|Amazon]]\n- [[Entities/GitHub|GitHub]]\n\n### ⚙️ 注目技術\n- [[Technologies/transformer|transformer]]\n- [[Technologies/LLM|LLM]]\n- [[Technologies/diffusion|diffusion]]\n- [[Technologies/RAG|RAG]]\n- [[Technologies/LoRA|LoRA]]\n- [[Technologies/Docker|Docker]]"
    },
